==German==

===Etymology===
Humorous feminine form of {{m|de|Bulle||cop}}, formed to sound alike to the eastern German word {{m|de|Bulette||meatball}} and only common where this latter word is used.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bʊˈlɛtə/|lang=de}}
* {{homophones|lang=de|Bulette}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Bulletten}}

# {{lb|de|regional|pejorative}} a female [[cop]]
# {{lb|de|regional|slang}} a [[Berlin]] citizen

